{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_title", "source_sha256": "17144dfef368c4956bc0e9daebe58bb95d6c6c3c4b6fb64a3aea293e1f4fa323", "ja": "真夏の祭典！", "zh": "盛夏的祭典！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_synopsis", "source_sha256": "94a3147874ec2cfafd9b42435db177c5df9c608837af7eba86b1dcdaff878e02", "ja": "真夏のライブフェス開催！\n爽やかな水着衣装を着て、ライブの\n出番を待つ、アイドル達の一幕です。", "zh": "盛夏的演唱会祭典开幕！\n这是穿着清新泳装的偶像们\n在等待出场期间的一幕场景。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1000_p", "source_sha256": "309064a4005ccd9d1d45cc26474c089175cbc167248d91d008d9b44f5830f119", "ja": "（夏といえばフェス！　我が765プロも夏のフェスに\n出演することになったが、さて、皆の様子は……）", "zh": "（说到夏天就会想到祭典！我们765艺能也要\n在夏日祭典中出场，不知道大家的状况如何……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1001_046rio", "source_sha256": "ec52003be393bc80fbfd284f03ca6dbe53ecb2613a4741c2db78c0aa58101fdc", "ja": "もう、風花ちゃんたらいい加減出てきてよー！\n大丈夫、絶対可愛いから！", "zh": "真是的，风花你快点出来啦──！\n放心，一定很可爱的啦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1002_039kon", "source_sha256": "44143aaf23fa3cdbcd5a4fba1b48c7c9a46b30d3a6c1761ac530a92e6a65f883", "ja": "そうよー！　せっかく素敵な衣装なんだし……。\nほ、ほら、これだって見ようによっては清純派よ。", "zh": "就是说啊！难得穿上了这么棒的服装……\n你、你看，这套服装换个角度看不也很清纯吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1003_041fuk", "source_sha256": "9486d380e479a1ffdfd69d7e082516b44eddea484665c3f05161e1c0afa9f1db", "ja": "このみさん、これで清純は無理がありますよぉ！\nだ、だめ、やっぱり恥ずかしい……。", "zh": "木实，说这套服装清纯实在太牵强了啦！\n不、不行，我还是觉得很害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1004_046rio", "source_sha256": "76f6b6a52772d0055300338b905f2136b53adcb262e9b5085272a7e9ff6f6a89", "ja": "んー、やっぱりそうなるか。でもほら、\nセーラーといえば青春……ほらっ！　清純派じゃない♪", "zh": "嗯～果然不行啊，不过你想想，\n说到水手服就会想到青春……看！这不是很清纯吗♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1005_041fuk", "source_sha256": "251951b75edeafc6aa77fe786260a8d3bc870fcc0f6f12e8827c0b401e895ad2", "ja": "ほらっ、じゃないですー！　セーラーはともかく、\n下半身は完全にキワドイ水着じゃないですかー！！", "zh": "我看不出来啦～！水手服也就算了，\n这下半身根本就是性感泳装嘛──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1006_046rio", "source_sha256": "fd3f494805a84e9ef5b5a9cf7ad21f6c829a1bfe2f4fc9c0b728f756cc16e1c4", "ja": "んもー、そこがいいとこじゃないっ！\nわかってないんだからぁ♪", "zh": "唉唷～就是这样才棒啊！\n你真是不懂耶♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1007_p", "source_sha256": "a960754519dad3d99e5ea923db4acb05d202cd8fe0ccd8871ea87dbd11fa25f8", "ja": "うーん、やっぱり風花は恥ずかしいか。\nどうしたものか……。", "zh": "嗯～风花果然还是会害羞呢。\n该怎么办才好……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1008_019min", "source_sha256": "3d9e6b905703529a9a7586d8324480ea7784c7c45f30d24d6ee110999f4c27b0", "ja": "莉緒さん、このみさん、何してるんですか？\nもうすぐ本番ですけど……。", "zh": "莉绪姊、木实姊，你们在做什么？\n马上就要正式上场了耶……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1009_p", "source_sha256": "91c7d318a58a471047da77ab7a645ceb645e874be02acb03c7c1ede71411e547", "ja": "それが……。", "zh": "其实……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1010_037nao", "source_sha256": "b74b91275711d3017f0ec4766d4353d1ed3bdcf9401f945136f1a63eab3f99fa", "ja": "あーそっか、風花が衣装恥ずかしがって\nなかなか出てきてくれへんのやな。", "zh": "啊～原来如此。风花觉得服装太令人害羞，\n迟迟不肯出来啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "ff9a3c6e7425f6404558fe2e63fa44abb0f2b1068c3a118542d27cbdd04c2577", "ja": "そうなのよ！　ねえ、奈緒ちゃん。何か\n風花ちゃんを引っぱり出す、いい策はないかしらね？", "zh": "就是这样！我说奈绪，\n你有没有什么把风花拉出来的好方法？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1012_037nao", "source_sha256": "b6b304c8ffb3ce830332f9014fc504e4128b6b2425e182dd45fb593df300cd30", "ja": "んー、せやなぁ。あ、食べ物のいい匂いとか\nさせたらいいんとちゃう？　たこ焼きでも焼く？", "zh": "嗯～这个嘛……啊，用食物的香味引诱她怎么样？\n要不要来做个章鱼烧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1013_019min", "source_sha256": "c85f0ef3f4134d8825571bd426364310842cb8eceaaa21d638096554e19562a1", "ja": "わっほーい！　本番前の腹ごしらえ、いいですねっ！\n焼きそばやチャーハンも作っちゃいましょう！", "zh": "哇哦──！正好能在正式上场前垫垫胃，真是好主意！\n也做点炒面和炒饭吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1014_034ayu", "source_sha256": "6a4bf246e7d23e0a37ef1a9dc635510364b1d6dca875064c2a674b8f5f4f4792", "ja": "え、なになにご飯の話？　うう、アタシ今回のフェスに\n向けて体絞ってたから、そういうのに弱い……。", "zh": "咦？什么，你们在聊吃的吗？呜呜，我为了这次的祭典\n拼命控制饮食，对这种话题很没抵抗力啦……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1015_019min", "source_sha256": "04928cef90865019f144ec2310614df1a4d034e78a2b4a589a788e02b7fdb4c5", "ja": "よーしっ、じゃあちょっと簡易キッチン借りて\n作ってくる！　どんどん食べてフェスを盛り上げよう♪", "zh": "好，那我去借用简易厨房做点吃的回来！\n我们要大吃特吃，炒热祭典气氛♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1016_p", "source_sha256": "a430a4bdaec347cb15fe8feaa3ef21c27eaed7c0afcb2252fc813c7d1ca3dda8", "ja": "あっ、美奈子！　そんな時間もう……\n行ってしまったか。", "zh": "啊，美奈子！已经没时间……\n跑掉了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1017_034ayu", "source_sha256": "8cd4b5e42b7835c2a574630d1b815083b184622b384dfee6ab7b947fc225662e", "ja": "時間？　……マイガー！　もう本番まで、あとちょっと\nじゃん！　風花は出てこないしご飯も……焦るーっ！", "zh": "时间？My God！距离正式上场没剩多少时间了！\n风花不肯出来，饭也还没吃到……真是急死人了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1018_p", "source_sha256": "69355093fb3d335eb6e7a80039e0a16d161e6f86bb246ef45c3f7a9658914e79", "ja": "歩、今更ご飯は食べなくていい！　おーい美奈子！\n戻って来ーい！", "zh": "步，现在不要管吃饭了！\n喂──美奈子！快回来──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1019_019min", "source_sha256": "a5b71130406d0ecc68d97cbfbbb73030f18be47c7ab5998e253484a410d8b0d1", "ja": "ええー？　パパッと作ってパパッと食べれば大丈夫\nじゃないですかー？", "zh": "咦──？\n快快做完快快吃掉不就行了吗──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1020_p", "source_sha256": "35de3933d12b40f198d37807ab5f32b03091516c0839212654ab395ebfb33ac2", "ja": "いや、本当にそんな時間ないから！\nふう、あとは風花を引っ張り出さなきゃ……。", "zh": "不，真的没时间了啦！\n呼，接着得把风花拉出来……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1021_011ami", "source_sha256": "62faec584f38000567973aafcad6de6f61717728e2cc6da4ff03fbb9ea361477", "ja": "兄ちゃんー、衣装チェック終わったよ～。\nどうどう？　亜美のせくしーバディ♪", "zh": "大哥哥～试装结束啰～\n怎么样怎么样？亚美的身材很性感吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1022_p", "source_sha256": "14e88f78ce2039101e8ead264af7ce85d3cbd00508ceff8f3e6212e5cadaa6c2", "ja": "ああ、亜美。ぴったり似合ってるぞ。\nセクシーかどうかは置いといてだけど……。", "zh": "嗯，亚美，服装很适合你喔。\n至于性不性感，我们就先不讨论……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1023_005yay", "source_sha256": "558450dfe96a6eadd6e58f3be22a04d900fbbaa3ce27c3ea84ab051fe949b9ff", "ja": "{$P$}！　私はどうですか？\nこの水着、とってもカワイイですよね！", "zh": "{$P$}！那我呢？\n这套泳装超级可爱对吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1024_p", "source_sha256": "daa8762376ef27338ffd842dfdfc13062f8e9294521d4bb26ebd1041b4cdc75e", "ja": "ああ、やよいもバッチリ似合ってるぞ！\nカワイイ水着がぴったりだ。", "zh": "嗯，弥生也非常适合喔！\n可爱的泳装和你很搭呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1025_005yay", "source_sha256": "a72fb9390ae4d21087afb8006055f864b6b476113e0021fc77a05ef33689a343", "ja": "うっうー！　{$P$}に、\nほめられちゃいました！　うれしいなー、えへへ♪", "zh": "呜呜──！我被{$P$}称赞了！\n真开心～嘿嘿♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1026_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8335b4e64db8f5bf79a6112bf7f0ce40d7520f2cad5a4d9fb7bef0d6cac4c8ec", "ja": "ゆ、勇気を出して……でも……うう……。\nブツブツ。", "zh": "我、我要鼓起勇气……可是……呜呜……\n（自言自语）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1027_011ami", "source_sha256": "dbdb4f4cefdaf7d28f8b3d9cceba5ae1f7e4f5216ed07ac2d3fa18ef89d0153e", "ja": "ん？　なんか遠くから聞こえるよん？\n兄ちゃん、どったのこれ。", "zh": "嗯？远处好像传来了什么声音耶？\n大哥哥，那是怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1028_005yay", "source_sha256": "e4d19036620e39e548e0b2c74b0e657729dc225a82baae9e940df26406de6ac1", "ja": "この声は……風花さんですかー？\n風花さーん？　どこに隠れてるんですかー？", "zh": "这个声音……是风花姊姊吗？\n风花姊姊──？你躲在哪里啊──？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1029_p", "source_sha256": "ce43f12a66e8d144a3f576d1e4361d9668a74f31449d476f62ee8a0e188509fd", "ja": "ああ、そうなんだ。風花がこの衣装に恥ずかしがって、\nなかなか出て来てくれなくて困っているんだ。", "zh": "嗯，是风花没错。她觉得穿那套服装太害羞，\n所以迟迟不肯出来，真让人伤脑筋。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1030_p", "source_sha256": "831911fe53817993c293513efad2aaf6761106883222b8b00f7b6792aa6490db", "ja": "おーい風花、いい加減観念してくれー！\n絶対、似合ってるから、なんの問題もないって！", "zh": "喂──风花，你也该出来了吧──！\n你穿起来一定很适合，没什么好担心的！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1031_041fuk", "source_sha256": "8521b4de6f674286c0e8e46235f1b2e0e0b51ad761322702f9bc78abb6cbb6bf", "ja": "そ、そういう問題じゃありませんー！\nやっぱり、私には無理ですー！", "zh": "不、不是适不适合的问题啦──！\n我果然还是办不到──！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1032_005yay", "source_sha256": "9570372cc501931211b204358f623f3c21b39852391042409f3838677d6ed5db", "ja": "風花さん、水着が恥ずかしくなっちゃったんですね。\nでも、うーん。どうしたらいいんでしょう……。", "zh": "风花姊姊觉得穿泳装很害羞啊。\n可是，嗯～该怎么办才好呢……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1033_011ami", "source_sha256": "76c4b132a623dc7e55aabb24ff35f659f17e963669f58175fdc6b3b969d266ce", "ja": "んっふっふ～♪　亜美にいい考えがあるよ！\n風花お姉ちゃーん！", "zh": "嗯哼哼～♪亚美有一个好主意喔！\n风花大姊姊～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1034_p", "source_sha256": "1628c83decda8feab730c8450eafd9422de02c0dc640ae5460594e6dc6dcc7eb", "ja": "あ、亜美！？", "zh": "亚、亚美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1035_011ami", "source_sha256": "126f51505bb3223d24bb891c8e7c3c93faed8b7b41dc73da26d97b2a8a15dc07", "ja": "風花お姉ちゃん、亜美から挑戦状だよっ！\nいざ、せくしー対決！　うっふーん♪", "zh": "风花大姊姊，亚美要对你下战书！\n来场性感大对决吧！嗯哼～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1036_041fuk", "source_sha256": "f217d81cad7ace174ae0e384f35155c336daec5857181c9f4f8390ee431f6892", "ja": "はえっ！？　あ、亜美ちゃん、どこから\n入ってきたの……じゃなくて！", "zh": "咦！？\n亚、亚美，你是从哪里进来的……不对！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1037_011ami", "source_sha256": "ed7479fb8c30de58c6d370d2e8f9a01581c1613116480d86176c275fe91c1464", "ja": "亜美の方がせくしーだったら、風花お姉ちゃんも\nみんなのとこ行こうね。あっは～ん♪", "zh": "要是亚美赢了，\n风花大姊姊就要出去跟大家会合喔，啊哈～♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1038_041fuk", "source_sha256": "22d0221fc611b7ea3e87384b7e10a8f8136b85fe15ba523bb1473b4583596efb", "ja": "ええっ、うう、そんな……亜美ちゃぁん！？", "zh": "咦……呜呜，怎么这样……亚美！？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1039_011ami", "source_sha256": "63bd980ec5ed3abe0a2153986651b1517d91f0aac3cecddf6b3b5ff07da75708", "ja": "あっは～ん♪　いや～ん♪　チラ、チラ。\n……にじにじ。ほら、お姉ちゃんも！", "zh": "啊哈～♪讨厌啦～♪偷瞄、偷瞄。\n（逼近）来嘛，大姊姊也一起！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1040_041fuk", "source_sha256": "83ff6cd74b900539b43aaa541cafa98a176dbaeda70f5ca930dbb59ea611b0ee", "ja": "だ、だめ。そんな大胆なポーズ、私には\nできないよぉ。", "zh": "不、不行，\n我摆不出那么大胆的姿势啦。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1041_011ami", "source_sha256": "47923312f136ab9faef74c5cf0280b8cecdc623a23d2e9fcdb92f3ab20f3e512", "ja": "ん？　てことはこの勝負、亜美の勝ちー♪\nさ、風花お姉ちゃん、いこいこ♪", "zh": "嗯？这么说是亚美赢啰～♪\n好啦，风花大姊姊，走吧走吧♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1042_041fuk", "source_sha256": "854c49ee6dcdb23f961d32a29a05c94a2d5fe8096fa98fdd23a46d31f278f275", "ja": "な、なんでそうなるのー！？\nいやー！！", "zh": "为、为什么会变成这样啊──！？\n不要啊──！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1043_p", "source_sha256": "933d0cce85e26f715320529e74804208058566130010a00d26716e2725e0c0f5", "ja": "おお！　風花、待ちくたびれたぞ。\nすごく似合っているな、セーラーミズギ。", "zh": "喔喔！风花，等你很久啰。\n水手服泳衣很适合你呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1044_039kon", "source_sha256": "161bccf6b05394005817cba96f6d6bd38ccf13d34bf1b359028933dcd02ee4c8", "ja": "あら、ほんとだわ！　いつものグラビア水着より、\n爽やかな魅力があって……さすが風花ちゃんね♪", "zh": "哎呀，真的耶！比起以往的写真泳装，\n多了种清新的魅力……真不愧是风花♪", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1045_041fuk", "source_sha256": "0cb071653d8eb475b3eb62943716ff241ec68b80adc08658bc5177fe5683786a", "ja": "え、爽やか……そ、そうですか？　えへへ……。\nなんだか嬉しくて、くすぐったい……。", "zh": "咦，清新……有、有吗？嘿嘿……\n总觉得有点开心，又有点害羞……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1046_041fuk", "source_sha256": "e87bd770c33613fbc62e07528c366d992839960e44d177adbb4dc1c7c332a829", "ja": "でも、そうですね……響ちゃんや瑞希ちゃんも頑張って\nるんだし。私一人が尻込みしてちゃ……よ、よし！", "zh": "不过，说得也是……响和瑞希也都很努力，\n我不能自己一个人畏首畏尾的……好、好吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1047_p", "source_sha256": "0e64e4bffe30014edac1ee09d0c591c2c87674aa704b395a1c88a3b513b2479a", "ja": "おお、やる気になってくれたか！　じゃあ全員揃った\nところで……いつもの行くぞ。やよい掛け声よろしく！", "zh": "喔喔，你总算提起干劲啦！那既然所有人都到齐了……\n就按照惯例来喊口号吧。弥生，麻烦你起个头！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "special_019_cc_01_jp.gtx", "item_key": "special_019_cc_01_1048_005yay", "source_sha256": "5c4cdb72e84e847b162d42acf18651c77b4c31a6be9bfd7f8c040686b51d5935", "ja": "はーい！\nみんな、行きますよ？　せーの！", "zh": "好的～！\n大家，要开始啰？预备～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
